          "sha": "ed7dd7cf4e1561a97edf72eba29a67b14e28c717",
          "html_url": "https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/commit/ed7dd7cf4e1561a97edf72eba29a67b14e28c717"
        }
      ],
      "message": "psbt: verify final scripts in FinalizePSBT\n\nFinalizePSBT counts an input as complete whenever SignPSBTInput succeeds.\nFor an input that already has final_script_sig/final_script_witness,\nFillSignatureData marks the signature data complete and ProduceSignature\nreturns true before running its script check, so the existing final\nfields are never verified. finalizepsbt then returns complete=true and a\nhex that is rejected by the mempool, while analyzepsbt reports the same\ninput as not final.\n\n#30357 fixed this for FillPSBT by using PSBTInputSignedAndVerified. Do\nthe same in FinalizePSBT.",
      "committer": {
        "name": "Bruce0X",
        "email": "109469941+Bruce039@users.noreply.github.com",
        "date": "2026-09-26T09:54:55Z"
      },
